{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52147","headline":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 三 · 许敬宗","name":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇灵拓统，帝宅遐光。\n驰威日域，浃化乾纲。\n网罗千代，并吞百王。\n祯凝国太（疑应作「泰」），庆袭元良。\n（其三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}